{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "button",
  "category": "basic",
  "semantic": {
    "policy": "fixed",
    "defaultRole": "button"
  },
  "summary": "表单主次操作；色槽走 Token-ref，loading 保留文案，disabled 走 opacity.disabled。",
  "behavior": [
    "色外观只通过 bgColor / borderColor / textColor（Bind 池 Token ID 或 transparent）表达，禁止实例硬编码色值",
    "未传 borderColor 时与 bgColor 相同；未传 textColor 时按底色推导（实色→on-*，*-soft→对应实色，透明底→边框色或 color.action）",
    "loading 时不可点，spinner 与文案同时可见，不得用加载图标替换文字",
    "loading 阻止重复触发但保留强调度；只有 disabled 使用 opacity.disabled",
    "默认主操作：bgColor=color.action（及配对文字/边框），不把公开语义绑到实现层样式枚举"
  ],
  "propsSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "label": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "bgColor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Background Token-ref (Bind color id or transparent)."
      },
      "borderColor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Border Token-ref; defaults to bgColor."
      },
      "textColor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Foreground Token-ref; defaults from bgColor pairing."
      },
      "size": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["sm", "md", "lg"]
      },
      "loading": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "block": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "disabled": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["button", "submit", "reset"]
      }
    },
    "required": ["label"]
  },
  "defaultProps": {
    "label": "确认",
    "bgColor": "color.action",
    "borderColor": "color.action",
    "textColor": "color.on-action",
    "size": "md",
    "loading": false,
    "block": false,
    "disabled": false
  },
  "states": [
    {
      "id": "loading",
      "label": "加载",
      "kind": "interaction",
      "props": {
        "loading": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "disabled",
      "label": "禁用",
      "kind": "interaction",
      "props": {
        "disabled": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "slots": ["default"],
  "events": ["click"],
  "tokenBindings": {
    "background": "color.action",
    "border": "color.action",
    "onBackground": "color.on-action",
    "radius": "radius.md",
    "elevation": "elevation.none",
    "height": "sizing.control-md",
    "paddingX": "spacing.md",
    "typography": "typography.label",
    "disabledOpacity": "opacity.disabled",
    "overlayOpacity": "opacity.hidden",
    "loadingOpacity": "opacity.visible",
    "borderWidth": "border.width-hairline",
    "duration": "motion.duration-fast",
    "easing": "motion.easing-standard",
    "pressedScale": "motion.scale-pressed"
  },
  "playground": {
    "presentation": "interactive"
  }
}
